  "description": "After marrying her dream man and ascending the throne, Empress Adrisa seems to have everything. But, no matter what she tries, she can’t capture the emperor’s heart. Emperor Rothbart never forgave Adrisa for the conniving that brought her to his side, tormenting his wife as revenge for his fate. But in a parallel world, the couple’s destiny is far different. On the brink of madness after the loss of his wife, there is another Emperor Rothbart who would do anything to be close to Adrisa again. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
